% Destructures wrap/1, so the clause heads type-check only against the LOCAL
% NetMsg/1.  Had NetMsg resolved to mad_predicates' NetMsg/0 (msg(Constant, _)),
% this head would be ill-typed rather than merely unresolved.
exported procedure go(NetMsgList(Constant)?).
go([]).
go([wrap(_)|Xs]) :- go(Xs?).
